      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Charge honesty\nPhases: Plugged → Starting → Charging → Stopped/Complete → Disconnected. `Stopped` is a pause. `Complete` is at limit, still plugged. **Only `Disconnected`/explicit Disconnected state is unplug.** Complete→Disconnected dwell is etiquette time at DC, not a Tesla penalty score."
      },
